; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">한국의 문화를 체험하도록 함으로써 한국을 제대로 알 수 있는 유용한 기회를 제공</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">외국의 인재를 본교에 유치하여 대학 연구 인력을 확보하고 국제화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">세계화 시대에 맞는 대학 경쟁력 향상</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"><strong>지원자격</strong></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; MARGIN-LEFT: -1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font face=\"나눔고딕\">1</font>. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">고등학교 이상의 학력을 가진 외국인</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font face=\"나눔고딕\">2</font>. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">국내 및 국외 거주 외국인</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font face=\"나눔고딕\">3</font>. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">해외여행에 결격사유가 없는 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font face=\"나눔고딕\">4</font>. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">선발 우대 사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">: TOPIK </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">한국어능력시험 성적 소지자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"><strong>교과과정</strong></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; MARGIN-LEFT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">- 1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">개 반당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">20</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">여명을 정원으로 하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">언어교육의 기본인 문법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">말하기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">듣기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">쓰기 뿐 아니라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">실용적이고 다양한 수업방식을 활용하여 학생들이 보다 흥미롭게 한국어를 배울 수 있도록 커리큘럼을 구성</span></p></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-US\"><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"BORDER-TOP: #4c4c4c 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 19.48pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #4c4c4c 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 98.21pt; BACKGROUND: #1c3d62; BORDER-BOTTOM: #4c4c4c 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">구분</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"BORDER-TOP: #4c4c4c 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 19.48pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #4c4c4c 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 98.21pt; BACKGROUND: #1c3d62; BORDER-BOTTOM: #4c4c4c 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: #4c4c4c 0.28pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">수강시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #